Z||000001||pherder||01-23-2000||10:47 AM||||FYI - Lustine Parts Online has two in stock!<P> Discount prices valid for online orders only.<BR> <BR>Part Number Desciption Bin   Qty List    Sale<BR>10137017    PIPEKIT    3159G  2  $ 75.00 $ 56.25  <P>WARNING!!!!!<P>If you use this on line GM parts ordering ... INSURE that your shopping cart has the EXACT PART NUMBER and QUANITY listed!!!<P>I didn't and now I have 10 sunroof gaskets!!!<P>I ordered parts for a total of what I thought was $200 and got a bill for over $800!!!!!!!!!!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I am trying to get this problem solved at this time so the extra 9 are not for sale ... yet.<P>Their link is:   <A HREF="http://www.lustineparts.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.lustineparts.com/</A> <P>BTW, I have 9 extra right side dew wipes (yes, ordered 1 and 1 left ... didn't get the left ...) and 1 extra right side rain drip molding (ordered right and left, part number for left was changed to two rights!)<P>Their prices are good ... their web ordering sucks ... we will find how good their customer service is.  <P>Stay tuned!!!<P>Paul<P><p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 01-23-2000).]||||reg||4
